{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/8168be09ed3647118f42cce51d8472de.avif?t=1762459398\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the future. Cyberspace is now home to the Core, a network of digital spherical prisons designed to keep those within safely contained. You are a CoreRunner, one of the few who can fight a path to freedom. Skate, slash, and shoot your way to freedom in neon-drenched, high-speed battles across retrowave landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/da04a16bee3acca92cf8245fe2ea97db.poster.avif?t=1762459398\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/da04a16bee3acca92cf8245fe2ea97db.webm?t=1762459398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the Core security systems and define your own combat style, taking down foes at range with digital gunfire, getting in close and personal with the deadly katanas, or trapping them within your light trail until they crash and dissipate.\u00a0 Every motion is a weapon. Every second counts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CARVE YOUR PATH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve your path through waves of digital guardians while the environment itself turns against you. Every level pulses with electric intensity, every firefight becomes a test of agility and timing. The Core wants to keep you. Only a CoreRunner can lead the way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/26bb4375b274b10b0b11546a27c4da30.poster.avif?t=1762459398\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/26bb4375b274b10b0b11546a27c4da30.webm?t=1762459398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCALATING DANGER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The closer you get to freedom, the more guardians will try to stop you from escaping the Core. Fight turrets, drones, homing missiles, and hostile patrols in ever more intense battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/e9c205b897e4eebdd93277fccd0cb2cf.poster.avif?t=1762459398\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/e9c205b897e4eebdd93277fccd0cb2cf.webm?t=1762459398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PRECISION IN MOTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for mastery. Tight responsive controls keep every movement sharp and fast,\u00a0 even in the most challenging of arenas. Flow between dodging, aiming, and slashing without missing a beat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/97407b9d32e6fed9a8bedfd16bc6faac.poster.avif?t=1762459398\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/97407b9d32e6fed9a8bedfd16bc6faac.webm?t=1762459398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BURN THE NEON, BREAK THE BEAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride the rhythm of the Core. Every arena and gameplay experience is synchronized with the pulsating synthwave beat in your escape from digital captivity.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/c6653dc9b43a7b13c2fb49b5910bee67.poster.avif?t=1762459398\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/c6653dc9b43a7b13c2fb49b5910bee67.webm?t=1762459398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3415380?t=1762459398","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/0dff686b0907dae4e7b97c99bacd88bb50dde32e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762459398","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/41fb25c4f67d15a5813d675983613d26cf11a6c4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762459398","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/41fb25c4f67d15a5813d675983613d26cf11a6c4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762459398","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Characters show reactions when taking damage and emit light particle effects. "},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3575470,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>PLAY THE DEMO</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/07d7b70d000904db0d93e6c8d3f230c5.poster.avif?t=1762459398