 while the environment itself turns against you. Every level pulses with electric intensity, every firefight becomes a test of agility and timing. The Core wants to keep you. Only a CoreRunner can lead the way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/26bb4375b274b10b0b11546a27c4da30.poster.avif?t=1762459398\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/26bb4375b274b10b0b11546a27c4da30.webm?t=1762459398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCALATING DANGER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The closer you get to freedom, the more guardians will try to stop you from escaping the Core. Fight turrets, drones, homing missiles, and hostile patrols in ever more intense battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/e9c205b897e4eebdd93277fccd0cb2cf.poster.avif?t=1762459398\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/e9c205b897e4eebdd93277fccd0cb2cf.webm?t=1762459398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PRECISION IN MOTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for mastery. Tight responsive controls keep every movement sharp and fast,\u00a0 even in the most challenging of arenas. Flow between dodging, aiming, and slashing without missing a beat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/97407b9d32e6fed9a8bedfd16bc6faac.poster.avif?t=1762459398\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/97407b9d32e6fed9a8bedfd16bc6faac.webm?t=1762459398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BURN THE NEON, BREAK THE BEAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride the rhythm of the Core. Every arena and gameplay experience is synchronized with the pulsating synthwave beat in your escape from digital captivity.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/c6653dc9b43a7b13c2fb49b5910bee67.poster.avif?t=1762459398\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/extras/c6653dc9b43a7b13c2fb49b5910bee67.webm?t=1762459398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Garland"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415380/4f106a6fc0547726e2f781e7646990758c66247e/header.jpg?t=1762459398","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Garland & Freedom Games - All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.13.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 200 MB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor</li></ul>"},"